; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M10 (tick replay): ATRentry trailing (TrailMode 1), setup 4 of 4: sell, session AllDay server time, trend filter H1 EMA 100, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: 1.5 x ATR(14) of M10 at entry behind the best price once the profit reaches 0.5 x ATR, stop moved once per closed minute. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 1, TrailParam 0).
